  "$comment": "Run O1 lane K1 batch b5: series data for Tower of God (tier B), the Korean webtoon and its anime, built from pinned Wikipedia revisions (webtoon article, season 1 and season 2 articles, character list), Wikidata Q487202 (webtoon) and Q131160789 (anime), and the official pages of the webtoon (Webtoon) and of the anime (tog-anime.com); facts are drafts for review. The allowed sources name only the two season 2 story arcs, so the arcs are season 1 (episodes 1 to 13), Return of the Prince (14 to 26) and Workshop Battle (27 to 39), the last two being the two cours of season 2 (episodes run across the seasons), plus a webtoon-only arc for the material not yet animated. No webtoon chapter count or chapter ranges are stored because no allowed source states them. Character debut arcs come from the first named mention in the Wikipedia episode summaries (Hwa Ryun, Ha Jinsung, Urek Mazino, Ja Wangnan in season 2, Enryu in the Workshop Battle cour); White and Phantaminum are not named in any episode summary and are placed in the webtoon-only arc as manga characters, as an editorial judgment (when unsure the later arc was chosen). Korean names are given only where the character list gives them. Webtoon status is ongoing: the Webtoon page shows it paused between story seasons. Themes: season 1 by Stray Kids, season 2 first cour by NiziU and second cour by Stray Kids.",
